{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新するよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いやーもう冬ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくま元気にしてるかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと今頃冬眠してるんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところでみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくま知ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない方もいらっしゃると思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロフィールでもあげよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通称:しろくまりっくま(熊科の雌)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndから突然現れた幻の熊。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...本当に熊なのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正体は未だ解明されていない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格:温厚でおっとりしている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はのろい。無口。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭奪われると荒れる。強い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特徴:眉毛、顔がふたつあるところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常日頃顔が腑抜けている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然踊り荒れ狂う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好物:鮭。鮭しか食べない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭がないと生きていけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手:黒めの熊、人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許可なく顔写真載せちゃったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとで謝っておきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、寒くなったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん風邪ひいてませんか><？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜あったまるよ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番気に入ってるところは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビのフリすごいかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで行進するところもすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付き合うならどうして中田なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はきっと男の子になっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんどくさいかまってちゃんだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にさばさばしてる中田様が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女さんだったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな感じかなーって思って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...根拠はない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんはツンが強いデレなんだぜ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼は若月です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかと奪い合う毎日。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子の種類で一番好きなのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット帽。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかのお兄ちゃんって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな人なのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー最近は落ち着きすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいると私がうるさいみたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じなのだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機会音痴な私を助けてくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい理系のお兄ちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、万理華ちゃんの絵を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たことないけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度、適当なものを絵に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描いてみせてくれないかな？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに載せたことあるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近だと、241回目の記事です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細かいのをちょこちょこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描くのがすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を描くの、実はすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wii持ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレは足元からじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性にどんな靴はいてもらいたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古っぽい感じのとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とんがってないもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下メンバーからは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな接し方されてんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじられ倒される。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年関係ないね、もう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術の成績はどうだったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校はないんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学はずっと5だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2490711/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}